{"id":"baalah","name":"Baalah","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:baalah"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Baalah","text":"Mistress; city. (1.) A city in the south of Judah (Josh. 15:29), elsewhere called Balah (Josh. 19:3) and Bilhah (1 Chr. 4:29). Now Khurbet Zebalah. (2.) A city on the northern border of the tribe of Judah (Josh. 15:10), called also Kirjath-jearim, q.v. (15:9; 1 Chr. 13:6), now Kuriet-el-Enab, or as some think, ‘Erma. (3.) A mountain on the north-western boundary of Judah and Dan (Josh. 15:11)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H6107","lemma":"עֶצֶם","xlit":"ʻEtsem","gloss":"Etsem, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Azem, Ezem","count":3,"share":0.6},{"strong":"H1173","lemma":"בַּעֲלָה","xlit":"Baʻălâh","gloss":"Baalah, the name of three places in Palestine","kjv":"Baalah","count":3,"share":0.6},{"strong":"H3802","lemma":"כָּתֵף","xlit":"kâthêph","gloss":"the shoulder","kjv":"arm, corner, shoulder, side","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H6828","lemma":"צָפוֹן","xlit":"tsâphôwn","gloss":"hidden","kjv":"north","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H1366","lemma":"גְּבוּל","xlit":"gᵉbûwl","gloss":"a cord","kjv":"border, bound, coast, great","count":2,"share":0.4},{"strong":"H3220","lemma":"יָם","xlit":"yâm","gloss":"a sea or large body of water","kjv":"sea ), south, west","count":2,"share":0.4}],"verses":["Josh.15.29","Josh.19.3","1Chr.4.29","Josh.15.10","Josh.15.11"],"related":[{"id":"azem","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.6,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"ezem","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.6,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"bilhah","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.143,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"azem","type":"lexical","strong":"H6107","why":"both lead with עֶצֶם (H6107)"},{"id":"ezem","type":"lexical","strong":"H6107","why":"both lead with עֶצֶם (H6107)"}],"works":[]}
